    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23683" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inquĭētūdo</span></b> ,
			ĭnis, f.
		inquieto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>restlessness</i>, <i>disquietude.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: de aliqua re
			sustinere, Cod. 7, 14, 5.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>feverishness</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Marc. Emp. 20 <i>med.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capitis inquietudo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 1</span></i>
			.</div>
